  <name>RigRoom</name>
  <summary>High-performance guitar &amp; bass multieffects host and plugin router</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      RigRoom is an open-source real-time audio plugin host and signal router built for guitarists and bassists.
      It supports LV2, CLAP, and VST3 plugins with low-latency JACK/PipeWire audio routing, flexible parallel/serial node canvases, and AI neural amp modeling.
    </p>
  </description>

